Error [E0988]: named loops use `::`, not `@`
  --> tests/ui/loop_label_prefix_old_form.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     outer@ loop i in [1, 2, 3] {
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: prefix `@` is for compile-time names and fact reads, not loop labels (D-LOOPLABEL3, D-ONCE-AT1=D)
 Fix: write `outer :: loop { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0988

Error [E0988]: named loop exits use target arguments
  --> tests/ui/loop_label_prefix_old_form.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |         break outer@
    |               ^^^^^^
 Why: prefix `@` is for compile-time names and fact reads, not loop labels (D-LOOPLABEL3, D-ONCE-AT1=D)
 Fix: write `break(outer)`
